This is the direction I was going in. I had something similar, generated by Gemini. I often use AI as a teaching tool, writing code which I then pick it apart to get my head around it. I thought there might have been a simple command in RPG Maker MZ that I'd somehow missed to achieve this, but it seems not to be the case.
I'm unfamiliar with the concept of "scenes" in this context. When I first heard it, I thought it was referring to a cutscene.
